lg:FR-CNIL-2020-092-p12-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "2ab8a0b53746bbb41a91eab3d78f0a51962d04dfabd03c2295b55b10f63aae01" ;
    lgo:text "As recalled in the guidelines, the purposes of the trackers must be presented to the users before they are offered the possibility to consent or to refuse. They must be formulated in an intelligible way, in language adapted and sufficiently clear to allow the users to understand precisely what they consent to."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:FR-CNIL-2020-092-p12-q1 .

lg:FR-CNIL-2020-092-p27-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "f8af995d864dcdcc3a0904b8b8bc0cbaa709830bc634d88b7560314990ce19af" ;
    lgo:text "In this regard, the Commission points out that global acceptance and refusal buttons may be offered at the first level of information, via for example the presentation of buttons titled “accept all” and “refuse all”, “I authorise” and “I do not authorise”, “I accept everything” and “I accept nothing” and allowing consent or refusal, in a single action, to several purposes."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:FR-CNIL-2020-092-p27-q1 .

lg:FR-CNIL-2020-092-p32-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "698ed9c97b22ca7c77a5a5f7e03d9a927bb30b570c5c4eba7878e4537b517d3b" ;
    lgo:text "For example, at the first level of information, users may have the choice between two buttons presented at the same level and in the same format, on which are written respectively “accept all” and “refuse all”, “authorise” and “prohibit”, or “consent” and “do not consent”, or any other equivalent and sufficiently clear formulation. The Commission considers that this method constitutes a simple and clear way to allow the user to express refusal as easily as consent."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:FR-CNIL-2020-092-p32-q1 .

lg:FR-CNIL-2020-092-p44-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "c543f403cbe7c06fea75e81d49efe426af82f53aae149a787f40471de87042e7" ;
    lgo:text "In any event, the Commission recommends that the mechanism for managing and withdrawing consent be placed in an area that draws the users' attention or in areas where they would expect to find it, and that the visuals used be as explicit as possible."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:FR-CNIL-2020-092-p44-q1 .

lg:FR-CNIL-2020-092-p46-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "2636f0ed9364c3791c957ed95dab0d789d1f3ccf208a1ebd0529af97eddfcd66" ;
    lgo:text "The controllers of the processing or processings must be able to demonstrate, at any time, that the users have given their consent. To this end, mechanisms making it possible to demonstrate that the users' consent was validly collected must be put in place."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:FR-CNIL-2020-092-p46-q1 .

lg:FR-CNIL-2020-092-p9-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "7786fbe10dea24a1910b3d0247fc9eb7daae8e2c02378a67bf15287313e78565" ;
    lgo:text "For the purposes of this recommendation, the absence of the users' consent is designated by the term “refusal”. Any inaction or action of the users other than a positive act signifying their consent must be interpreted as a refusal to consent; in that case, no reading or writing operation subject to consent may legally take place."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:FR-CNIL-2020-092-p9-q1 .

lg:FR-CNIL-SAN-2021-023-d1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "61dff03df92705110d7b56097b1f9ad2d0574ab189675a1af8e97d992b0e82c7" ;
    lgo:text "impose on the company [X] an administrative fine of 90,000,000 euros (ninety million euros) for breach of Article 82 of the Informatique et Libertés law"@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "claude-opus-5-5" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-04"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
