lg:FR-CNIL-SAN-2021-023-d3-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "aee37af5281facf3496cc052858a6af507679b5ba58d59ff2df3098701054c9d" ;
    lgo:text "issue an injunction against the companies [X] and [Y] to change, on the websites [V].fr and [W].com, the way they obtain the consent of users located in France to operations reading and/or writing information in their terminal, by offering them a means of refusing these operations as simple as the mechanism provided for accepting them, in order to guarantee the freedom of their consent; • attach to the injunction a penalty payment of 100,000 euros (one hundred thousand euros) per day of delay at the end of a period of three months following notification of this deliberation"@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "claude-opus-5-5" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-04"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:FR-CNIL-SAN-2021-023-d3-q1 .

lg:FR-CNIL-SAN-2021-023-p135-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "9860fba2fba9a0f36b4728ddadbc250aeb5b722448189b43bbffbe0d61bdbcd2" ;
    lgo:text "135. The restricted committee therefore considers that making the mechanism for refusing cookies more complex than the one for accepting them in reality discourages users from refusing cookies and encourages them to favour the ease of the Accept all button. An internet user is generally led to visit many websites. Browsing the internet is characterised by its speed and fluidity. Having to click on Personalise and having to understand how the page for refusing cookies is built is likely to discourage the user, who would nevertheless wish to refuse cookies. It is not disputed that, in the present case, the companies offer a choice between accepting and refusing cookies, but the way in which that refusal can be expressed, in the context of browsing the internet, biases the expression of choice in favour of consent so as to impair the freedom of choice."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "claude-opus-5-5" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-04"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:FR-CNIL-SAN-2021-023-p135-q1 .

