lg:FR-CNIL-SAN-2021-024-d2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "20a8657bf67c6007c8e97e9c45f2e4034a9610781b2d208e837e7e29ad2e463f" ;
    lgo:text "issue an injunction against the company [X] to change, on the website \"[V].com\", the way it obtains the consent of users located in France to operations reading and/or writing information in their terminal, by offering them a means of refusing these operations as simple as the mechanism provided for accepting them, in order to guarantee the freedom of their consent; attach to the injunction a penalty payment of one hundred thousand euros (100,000 euros) per day of delay at the end of a period of three months following notification of this deliberation"@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "claude-opus-5-5" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-04"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:FR-CNIL-SAN-2021-024-d2-q1 .

lg:FR-CNIL-SAN-2021-024-refus-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "879096742b08bb583a53d4766a4d2a3153cef821652b3d871784f0016a0f492e" ;
    lgo:text "In the present case, the restricted committee recalls that, as found during the online inspection of 8 April 2021, when a user residing in France visits the website \"[V].com\", they can accept advertising cookies in a single action, by clicking on the button labelled \"Accept cookies\" in the first window. It notes that, by contrast, to refuse these cookies the user must take no fewer than three actions: first click on the button labelled \"Manage data settings\" above the \"Accept cookies\" button in the first window, scroll through the entire content of the second window, in particular to see that the two sliders controlling advertising cookies are deactivated by default, and finally click on the \"Accept all\" button at the bottom of this second window."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "claude-opus-5-5" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-04"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:FR-CNIL-SAN-2021-024-refus-q1 .

